<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech SPT CZK 1.59 bln Q1 net profit -IAS.</title>
<headline>Czech SPT CZK 1.59 bln Q1 net profit -IAS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech telephone operator SPT Telecom a.s. on Wednesday said it posted a first quarter net profit, calculated according to international accounting standards (IAS), of 1.59 billion crowns.</p>
<p>SPT posted an IAS net profit of 1.75 billion crowns for the first three months of 1996.</p>
</text>
